{"title":"1998 USAMO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/2/e7226b681399519fb0afdad3c1664c7ca41ae517.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_0, \\ldots, a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"13\" /> be real numbers in the interval <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/a/15a0c06b7a84d80751e5f645a67a0b67c8ecae2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(0, \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"55\" height=\"35\" /> such that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/6939b9a1f03aa8b2505c5fb4c2f71fb8f8d2cfdd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\tan{\\left(a_0 - \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)} + \\tan{\\left(a_1 - \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)} + \\cdots + \\tan{\\left(a_n - \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)} \\geqslant n - 1.\\]\" width=\"473\" height=\"33\" />\n</p><p>Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/e/4ce0d07bc6095250b33387d87127eaf128176f2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan{(a_0)}\\tan{(a_1)} \\cdots \\tan{(a_n)} \\geqslant n^{n + 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"276\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/f/d8f1ac8ec62d4d93b7c6cdf96bd18e865908f391.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_i = \\tan{\\left(a_i - \\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\right)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"143\" height=\"35\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/7/18754e8aa9b2fc648e28296c6d1e322a99b04cb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 \\leqslant i \\leqslant n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"16\" />. Then we have:\n</p>\n<ul><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/3/0a375fb3ff627e410a3936746698a572016d1d05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_0 + y_1 + \\cdots + y_n \\geqslant n - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"207\" height=\"17\" />,</li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/2/00266200a7883c29a6bc345a69d884f5ef2d2c40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + y_i \\geqslant \\sum_{j \\neq i}{(1 - y_j)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -26px\" width=\"162\" height=\"46\" />,</li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/6/046f08b8218d6270d52ee6e24ca27a17e18a7e69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1 + y_i}{n} \\geqslant \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{j \\neq i}{(1 - y_j)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -26px\" width=\"183\" height=\"51\" />.</li></ul>\n<p>By AM-GM:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/9/56932c4a5121fe83e1dce76cfb564cca3c7d0ad8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{j \\neq i}{(1 - y_j)} &amp;\\geqslant \\prod_{j \\neq i}{(1 - y_j)^{\\frac{1}{n}}} \\\\ \\frac {1 + y_i}{n} &amp;\\geqslant \\prod_{j \\neq i}{(1 - y_j)^{\\frac{1}{n}}} \\\\ \\prod_{i = 0}^n\\frac{1 + y_i}{n} &amp;\\geqslant \\prod_{i = 0}^{n} {\\prod_{j \\neq i}{(1 - y_j)}^{\\frac{1}{n}}} \\\\ \\prod_{i = 0}^n\\frac{1 + y_i}{n} &amp;\\geqslant \\prod_{i = 0}^n{(1 - y_i)} \\\\ \\prod_{i = 0}^n\\frac{1 + y_i}{1 - y_i} &amp;\\geqslant \\prod_{i = 0}^n{n} \\\\ \\prod_{i = 0}^n\\frac{1 + y_i}{1 - y_i} &amp;\\geqslant n^{n + 1}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"252\" height=\"337\" />\n</p><p>Note that by the addition formula for tangents:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/e/91ee7a3a1d55632a019568149fd4296d4766fb14.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\tan{(a_i)} = \\tan{\\left[\\left(a_i - \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right) + \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right]} = \\frac{1 + \\tan{\\left(a_i - \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)}}{1 - \\tan{\\left(a_i - \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)}} = \\frac{1 + y_i}{1 - y_i}.\\]\" width=\"471\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/2/fc230d2f79dfa529711b6771c3faa254926a2697.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\prod_{i = 0}^n{\\frac{1 + y_i}{1 - y_i}} = \\tan{(a_0)}\\tan{(a_1)} \\cdots \\tan{(a_n)} \\geqslant n^{n + 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"376\" height=\"53\" />, as desired. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbb9e25e5be095e317771a9c5d00877ee9c8012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\blacksquare$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_USAMO\" title=\"1998 USAMO\">1998 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"1998 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1998 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_USAMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1998 USAMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017192019\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count